The immediate-after rules force the blocks Hana–Gus–Dev and Finn–Ben. Exactly one person between Dev and Elif, with Ann after Hana and before Elif, then forces Ann into the single open slot and Elif two after Dev. Exactly one person between Ben and Elif then places Finn–Ben two after Elif, and Cara must sit two after Finn. The only placement that fits in slots 1–9 with Ivo before Finn is:

SCHEDULE: {"1":"Ivo","2":"Hana","3":"Gus","4":"Dev","5":"Ann","6":"Elif","7":"Finn","8":"Ben","9":"Cara"}
CONFIDENCE: 99
